# Evidence subgroups, 2026-10-15. Rounds 1-3 measure the first rule (context separating); round 4 the final rule (identifier pattern, no context). Host load average 17-66 (other agents building).
# Round 1: before=0 after=1. Round 2: after=0 before=1. Round 3 (10,000 only): before=0 after=1, then after=0 before=1.
